###add item to cart
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productId": "6a9f050c6637a925b73c5dd7",
    "price": 300
}

###Get Cart items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/carts
Content-Type: application/json

###Increase or reduce quantity
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v2/carts/6aa4e5bc34418e62761c197e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "action": "minus" //'add' or 'minus' quantity
}

###Remove item of all item in cart
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/carts/6aa4e5bc34418e62761c197e
Content-Type: application/json